# DOT & DASH: Tuftville in the rug. The Snarl gang, east past the pot's
# saucer, stole the cover stone of the waxkin's Buzzbook: bring it back and
# Elder Tallow gives Dot the book (and 10). Eight waxlings wandered off all
# over the room (15 each, carried home); a Lumen scroll (15) and a purple
# germ (15) please him too.
game dotdash
wait 5
cheat newgame
cheat no_foes
cheat nodash
cheat god
cheat up tonic1
cheat up mitt1
cheat up satchel1
cheat up satchel2
# Snarl: the stone sits on a roof
cheat micro 0 83 57 4
cheat no_foes
wait 5
expect town == 1
cheat bot_to obj:26
botuntil bot_state == 2 3000
press B
wait 20
expect carry == 26
cheat grow
cheat micro 0 83 25 4
cheat no_foes
wait 5
cheat bot_to npc:17
botuntil bot_state == 2 3000
press UP
wait 5
cheat bot_talk
botuntil bot_state == 2 900
expect flag.snarl_done == 1
expect up.buzz1 == 1
# waxling 1
cheat grow
cheat micro 0 83 21 4
cheat no_foes
wait 5
cheat bot_to obj:28
botuntil bot_state == 2 4000
press B
wait 20
expect carry == 28
hold DOWN A 3
wait 3
